    <string name="consent_title">Legal Consent Required</string>
    <string name="consent_message">This application processes the following data in real time, entirely on your device:\n\n\u2022 Camera video \u2014 facial landmarks are extracted for visual speech recognition\n\u2022 Microphone audio \u2014 used in voice reconstruction modes (BC Larynx, EL Translator)\n\u2022 Bluetooth \u2014 routes audio to bone conduction headphones when connected\n\nAll biometric data stays in RAM and is never stored or transmitted. No data leaves this device.\n\nDo you consent to this processing?</string>
